msgstr ":icon:`fa-caret-square-o-right` :guilabel:`Elenco a scomparsa`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/html_editor.rst:132
msgid "Hide a group of text under a foldable toggle."
msgstr "Nascondi un gruppo di testo sotto un interruttore pieghevole."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/html_editor.rst:135
msgid ""
"To organize a table, hover over a column or row to reveal the table menu. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-h` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` icon to move, insert, "
"or delete a column or row."
msgstr ""
